      "value": "I should also mention that SOME avatars do this. for some reason dallas from payday 2 works fine but the only good connor model from detroit become human does not. I don't get it. it should be really easy to just align fbt with the bones that are available.\n\nEdit: It really is the one avatar that looks decent enough that somehow breaks. I tried resetting the avatar, the height, releasing the poses, but no luck. Some of RickyG192's avatars are that broken.",
